{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2020-03-23 11:30:00', 'title': 'PG&E REACHES PLEA AGREEMENT ON STATE CHARGES RELATED TO 2018 CAMP FIRE REAFFIRMS COMMITMENT TO GET VICTIMS PAID FAIRLY AND QUICKLY AND CONTINUE BUTTE COUNTY REBUILDING EFFORT', 'text': "PG&E REACHES PLEA AGREEMENT ON STATE CHARGES RELATED TO 2018 CAMP FIRE; REAFFIRMS COMMITMENT TO GET VICTIMS PAID FAIRLY AND QUICKLY AND CONTINUE BUTTE COUNTY REBUILDING EFFORT.PG&E CORP - WILL PAY MAXIMUM OF APPROXIMATELY $4 MILLION IN FINES INCLUDING EXPENSES RELATED TO DISTRICT ATTORNEY'S INVESTIGATION.PG&E CORP - AGREED TO FUND EFFORTS TO RESTORE ACCESS TO WATER FOR NEXT FIVE YEARS FOR RESIDENTS IMPACTED BY LOSS OF MIOCENE CANAL."}{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2020-03-23 10:30:00', 'title': "PG&E CORP CO ENTERED INTO PLEA AGREEMENT AND SETTLEMENT WITH BUTTE COUNTY DISTRICT ATTORNEY'S OFFICE", 'text': "PG&E CORP - ON MARCH 17, CO ENTERED INTO PLEA AGREEMENT AND SETTLEMENT WITH BUTTE COUNTY DISTRICT ATTORNEY'S OFFICE.PG&E CORP - ENTERED INTO AGREEMENT TO RESOLVE CRIMINAL PROSECUTION OF UTILITY IN CONNECTION WITH 2018 CAMP FIRE.PG&E CORP - UTILITY HAS AGREED TO PLEAD GUILTY TO 84 COUNTS OF INVOLUNTARY MANSLAUGHTER.PG&E CORP - UTILITY HAS AGREED TO PLEAD GUILTY TO ONE COUNT OF UNLAWFULLY CAUSING A FIRE.PG&E CORP - BUTTE COUNTY DA'S OFFICE AGREED NOT TO PROSECUTE ANY OTHER CRIMINAL CHARGES RELATED TO OR ARISING OUT OF 2018 CAMP FIRE AGAINST UTILITY.PG&E CORP - PURSUANT TO AGREEMENT, UTILITY WILL BE SENTENCED TO PAY MAXIMUM TOTAL FINE AND PENALTY OF APPROXIMATELY $3.5 MILLION.PG&E CORP - AGREEMENT PROVIDES THAT NO OTHER OR ADDITIONAL SENTENCE WILL BE IMPOSED ON UTILITY IN CRIMINAL ACTION IN CONNECTION WITH 2018 CAMP FIRE.PG&E CORP - UTILITY HAS ALSO AGREED TO PAY $500,000 TO BUTTE COUNTY DISTRICT ATTORNEY ENVIRONMENTAL AND CONSUMER PROTECTION FUND.PG&E CORP - COMMITTED TO SPEND UP TO $15 MILLION OVER FIVE YEARS TO PROVIDE WATER TO BUTTE COUNTY RESIDENTS IMPACTED BY DAMAGE TO UTILITY'S MIOCENE CANAL."}{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2020-03-23 09:30:00', 'title': 'PG&E TO PLEAD GUILTY TO INVOLUNTARY MANSLAUGHTER CHARGES IN DEADLY CALIFORNIA WILDFIRE - WSJ', 'text': ':PG&E TO PLEAD GUILTY TO INVOLUNTARY MANSLAUGHTER CHARGES IN DEADLY CALIFORNIA WILDFIRE'}